module mistake_nolink .
rem expect: E-FFI-LINK

rem ko: ✘ `link` 절이 없다 --- 어느 C 심볼을 부르는지 아무 데도 안 적혀 있다 /// en: ✘ no `link` clause --- nothing says which C symbol is called
unsafe extern proc c_area input k cap c . input w i64 . input h i64 . output i64 .
  effects unsafe .
end .

unsafe proc area_twice input k cap c . input w i64 . input h i64 . output i64 .
  effects unsafe .
do
  return add (c_area k w h) (c_area k w h) .
end .
